OL,3,GNEWSAWhat do unpaid carers want from
OL,4,Anext week's Budget?
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnpaid carers who say they always have
OL,7,Fto "fight the system" have appealed for
OL,8,Fmore financial support in the upcoming
OL,9,FBudget.
OL,11,FChancellor John Healey will set out the
OL,12,Fnew Andy Burnham government's tax and
OL,13,Fspending plans when he delivers his
OL,14,Ffirst Budget speech on 28 October.
OL,16,FAccording to the charity Carers UK,
OL,17,Fthere are an estimated 280,000 unpaid
OL,18,Fcarers in Greater Manchester alone.
OL,20,FThe true numbers are thought to be much
OL,21,Fhigher because many carers do not see
OL,22,Fthemselves as such.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
